:name: Execution trace + function coverage on the BlackPill F411 model
:description: Writes every executed PC to $trace (binary-free text, one hex PC per line); feed it to coverage.py.
$elf?=$ex_out/trace_demo.elf
$trace?=$ex_out/trace.txt

using sysbus
mach create "trace"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/../stm32f4_blackpill/blackpill_f411.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
cpu CreateExecutionTracing "tracer" $trace PC
